OL,3,GNEWSAPressure film nerve centre house
OL,4,A''quite plush'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's really humbling just to be there
OL,7,Fand think of all those huge decisions
OL,8,Fbeing made, but then you've got the
OL,9,Freality of the people participating on
OL,10,Fthe front lines losing their lives."
OL,12,FThe fate of the world hinged on
OL,13,Fdecisions made at Southwick House near
OL,14,FPortsmouth, which was the nerve centre
OL,15,Fof D-Day.
OL,17,FThe events that unfolded at the
OL,18,FGeorgian manor house during World War
OL,19,FTwo have been dramatised in the film
OL,20,FPressure, starring Andrew Scott and
OL,21,FBrendan Fraser.
