OL,3,GNEWSAPressure film nerve centre house
OL,4,A''quite plush'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to Dr Robert James, senior
OL,7,Flecturer in cultural and social history
OL,8,Fat the University of Portsmouth, it was
OL,9,Fthe perfect location because it was
OL,10,Fstrategically placed, secluded, and
OL,11,F"very plush".
